```text
Create empty stack S
Set x=0, flag=0, sum=0
Push x onto S
while (S is not empty){
    if (flag equals 0){
        Set x = x+1
        Push x onto S
        }
    if (x equals 8):
        Set flag=1
    if (flag equals 1){
        x = Pop(S)
        if (x is odd):
            Pop(S)
        Set sum = sum + x
        }
Output sum
```

